{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"web_search_instructions":"Scalable Press API v2 quote endpoint example address country product color fields next-level-boyfriend-tee"},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"web_search_instructions":"Scalable Press API v2 quote endpoint example address country product color fields next-level-boyfriend-tee"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Scalable Press API v2 Quote Endpoint Example Address Country Product Color Fields Next-Level Boyfriend Tee\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nThe Scalable Press API v2 provides a Quote endpoint that allows users to obtain pricing estimates for custom-printed products, including the Next Level Boyfriend Tee. To generate a quote, specific fields such as product ID, color, quantity, size, design ID, and shipping address details are required. Proper authentication using API credentials is mandatory for accessing this endpoint.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** The Quote API requires detailed product information, including product ID, color, quantity, size, and design ID, to generate an accurate quote.\n\n- **Finding 2:** Shipping address details, such as recipient name, street address, city, state, and ZIP code, are mandatory fields for the Quote API to calculate shipping costs.\n\n- **Finding 3:** Authentication is performed using HTTP Basic Authentication, where the API key serves as the password, and the username is left blank.\n\n- **Finding 4:** The API supports both standard and bulk quotes, with bulk quotes allowing for multiple designs and split shipping options.\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: API Documentation\n\n- **URL:** ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** scalablepress.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official API documentation)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Scalable Press API documentation outlines the Quote API's functionality, detailing the required fields and possible outcomes. It specifies that to generate a quote, users must provide product details (ID, color, quantity, size), a design ID, and a complete shipping address. The API supports both standard and bulk quotes, with bulk quotes offering additional features like multiple designs and split shipping. Authentication is achieved through HTTP Basic Authentication, using the API key as the password.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Product details required: ID, color, quantity, size\n\n- Mandatory shipping address fields: name, address1, city, state, zip\n\n- Authentication method: HTTP Basic Authentication with API key\n\n- Supports standard and bulk quotes\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"The Quote API lets you get an exact quote before placing an order.\"\n\n> \"Authentication headers are required.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Developer API | Print & Ship Products with Simple API Calls\n\n- **URL:** ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/api?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** scalablepress.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official API documentation)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis source provides an overview of the Scalable Press API, emphasizing its capabilities for programmatically sending customized products. It highlights the API's support for a wide range of products, fast turnaround times, and multiple production centers. The documentation includes example requests for creating design objects and placing orders, demonstrating the API's functionality.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Over 4,000 products available for customization\n\n- Typical order shipping within 1-3 business days\n\n- Multiple production centers in CA, IN, and PA\n\n- Example request for creating a design object provided\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"We believe ordering customized products should be as simple and inexpensive as ordering normal products.\"\n\n> \"Orders typically ship within 1 - 3 business days.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Scalable Press — API Provider, Schemas | APIs.io Providers\n\n- **URL:** ([apis.io](https://apis.io/providers/scalablepress/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** apis.io\n\n- **Publication Date:** Last month\n\n- **Source Type:** Other\n\n- **Credibility:** Medium (Third-party API directory)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis source provides an overview of the Scalable Press API, including available endpoints and their functionalities. It lists operations such as listing product categories, retrieving product information, and obtaining quotes. The documentation emphasizes the API's RESTful nature and its support for various HTTP methods.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Endpoints include: /v2/categories, /v2/products/:productId, /v2/quote\n\n- Supports HTTP methods: GET, POST\n\n- Provides detailed information about products and quotes\n\n- Described by OpenAPI 3.0.3\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Scalable Press Product API is one of 8 APIs that Scalable Press publishes on the APIs.io network.\"\n\n> \"This API exposes 5 operations across 5 paths, and defines 4 schemas.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- All sources agree that the Scalable Press API requires detailed product information and a complete shipping address to generate a quote. ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- Authentication using HTTP Basic Authentication with the API key as the password is consistently emphasized. ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No significant conflicting information was identified across the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific examples of using the Quote API with the Next Level Boyfriend Tee are not provided in the available sources.\n\n- Detailed error handling procedures for the Quote API are not extensively covered.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-23T03:18:02Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High (Based on the quality and consistency of the sources) "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"09374ab1-fe7e-4a45-a64e-80b599d86100"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
